'''Trials of Merc Storia!''' (強襲のメルクストーリア, ''Kyōshū no Meruku Sutōria'', '''Merc Storia Assault''') is a [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event|Merc Storia]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 9.10 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
Trials of Merc Storia! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Healer & Co. Lv.s'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Healer and Friends Lv. can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]], [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]] and Catamins. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Trials of Merc Storia!/Healer & Co. Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Trials of Merc Storia! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

